  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  NormTruncAll
  @  Everything about one point, tagged: CDF, PDF, CDFc, mean, deviation.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 5; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 5 ≠ THEN "NormTruncAll: needs 5 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → x0v scv Xminv Xmaxv Xv « x0v 0 + scv 0 + Xminv 0 + Xmaxv 0 + Xv 0 + → x0 sc Xmin Xmax X « 'IFTE(X≤Xmin;0;IFTE(X≥Xmax;1;(erf((X-x0)/(sc*√(2)))-erf((Xmin-x0)/(sc*√(2))))/(erf((Xmax-x0)/(sc*√(2)))-erf((Xmin-x0)/(sc*√(2))))))' →Num 'Kc' STO Kc "CDF" →Tag 'IFTE(X<Xmin;0;IFTE(X>Xmax;0;(EXP(-(((X-x0)/sc)^2)/2)/(sc*√(2*Ⓒπ)))/(0.5*(erf((Xmax-x0)/(sc*√(2)))-erf((Xmin-x0)/(sc*√(2)))))))' →Num "PDF" →Tag '1-Kc' →Num "CDFc" →Tag 'x0+sc*((EXP(-(((Xmin-x0)/sc)^2)/2)/√(2*Ⓒπ))-(EXP(-(((Xmax-x0)/sc)^2)/2)/√(2*Ⓒπ)))/(0.5*(erf((Xmax-x0)/(sc*√(2)))-erf((Xmin-x0)/(sc*√(2)))))' →Num "μ" →Tag 'sc*√(1+(((Xmin-x0)/sc)*(EXP(-(((Xmin-x0)/sc)^2)/2)/√(2*Ⓒπ))-((Xmax-x0)/sc)*(EXP(-(((Xmax-x0)/sc)^2)/2)/√(2*Ⓒπ)))/(0.5*(erf((Xmax-x0)/(sc*√(2)))-erf((Xmin-x0)/(sc*√(2)))))-(((EXP(-(((Xmin-x0)/sc)^2)/2)/√(2*Ⓒπ))-(EXP(-(((Xmax-x0)/sc)^2)/2)/√(2*Ⓒπ)))/(0.5*(erf((Xmax-x0)/(sc*√(2)))-erf((Xmin-x0)/(sc*√(2))))))^2)' →Num "sx" →Tag { Kc } PURGE x0v scv Xminv Xmaxv Xv 5 →List Drop » »
